    <briefdescription>
<para>The calibration plugin base classes of the horus_human nodes, one per input message type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Write a new calibration algorithm by deriving from one of these, exporting it with PLUGINLIB_EXPORT_CLASS(MyCalibration, horus_human::ImuCalibration) and pointing the node&apos;s <computeroutput>calibration.plugin</computeroutput> parameter at it. No node code changes. </para>
